# YOLO Mode workspace — audit trail
# ⚠️ TRACKED DURING DEV — run /prepare-public before making repo public
# ⛔ NEVER write production API keys, tokens, passwords, or any real
#    credential to ANY file under .yolo/ — these files commit to git
#    history on every YOLO push. Use os.environ[...] / process.env[...]
#    / ${VAR} instead. The pre-commit secret scanner (scripts/scan-secrets.ps1)
#    will block commits containing real-shape secrets, but the only safe
#    pattern is to never write them in the first place.
# .yolo/

# Multi-agent platform context
# CLAUDE.md / AGENTS.md / .cursorrules are thin pointer files regenerated by /sync-context — leave ignored
# Rules and knowledge are NOT mirrored into .claude/ — pointer files reference .agent/rules/_index.md directly
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
.cursorrules
